      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the \"support\" thing doesn't really change the reality. when i walk into a room, i'm not \"a person going through a hard time,\" i'm just the guy who lost everything. the guy who couldn't hold it together. i can see the look in people's eyes already. it's not just about the money, it's like the person i was is already dead. i'm just waiting for the rest of it to catch up. is there even a version of this where you don't end up as a cautionary tale for everyone else?",
